(2124021,0,''),
(2124021,1,''),
(2124023,0,'A must-have for a true collector. Use chests to organize your furniture, create donation boxes, display your furniture, or use Wired boxes to do all sorts of things with them!'),
(2124023,1,''),
(2124023,2,''),
(2124024,0,'Buy your very own Bot, they can talk, walk and add style to any dressing room!'),
(2124024,1,'Choose a bot of your fancy!\nNote: You can customise your bot once its in your room.'),
(2124024,2,''),
(2124025,0,'Let\'s get loud! Place a Jukebox in your room, add some disks from the \'Habbo Hotel Hits\' list below and you\'re ready to have a dance party!'),
(2124025,1,''),
(2124025,2,''),
(2124026,0,'Turn up the volume with some cool new tunes for your room. Place a Jukebox in your room, get yourself some of these song discs and add them to your playlist!'),
(2124026,1,'You need to be in a room to \n\"pre-listen\" to the disks!'),
(2124027,0,'However you place your essential Furniture, it\'s the finishing touches that count!'),
(2124027,1,''),
(2124027,2,''),
(2124028,0,'Welcome to the Art Gallery! Here you will find our diamond paintings and other art pieces.'),
(2124028,1,''),
(2124028,2,''),
(2124029,0,'You worked hard to get your badges, right? Now\'s the time to show it off, grab a display case and choose your favourite badge to show off!'),
(2124029,1,''),
(2124029,2,''),
(2124030,0,'After a busy day making new friends and exploring the Hotel you\'ll need a good night\'s sleep! Pick your fave from our range of stylish beds and get some much needed rest. '),
(2124030,1,''),
(2124030,2,''),
(2124031,0,'Rugs for all occasions, all non-slip and washable.'),
(2124031,1,''),
(2124031,2,''),
(2124032,0,'You can\'t just leave your friends standing there when you invite them over! Have a look at our huge selection of chairs and take your pick.'),
